; ============================================================================
; BSYS_BookMovedUDE
; ============================================================================
; "ShowOff:OnAdd" handler, filtered to the ledger book instance: fires
; whenever the book lands in any container via a vanilla add path (looting
; it, stashing it, selling it). Records the new holder so the reconstruct
; pass after the next load can put the book back where it belongs.
; ============================================================================

Create: BSYS_BookMovedUDE

ref rItem
ref rOwner

Begin Function { rItem, rOwner }
  Player.AuxVarSetRef "_BSYS_rBookOwner" rOwner

  if rOwner == PlayerREF
    Player.AuxVarSetFlt "_BSYS_bBookTaken" 1
  endif
End
